{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f47eeede-dfb1-8e47-8c4c-41908a894fcf",
  "created_at": "2026-02-22T15:16:17-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Joao Medeiros",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T15:14:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T15:14:42-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. Yeah, I wasn't sure anybody would pick up. I know City Hall's closed on a Sunday, so I figured I'd get a recording. I didn't expect a person this fast."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T15:14:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We keep this line staffed during the storm. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T15:14:56-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The street in front of my house is a pond. Right now. Cars are going by and throwing wakes up on the sidewalk. Kind of impressive, honestly, if it wasn't my street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T15:15:07-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh no. And what's the address there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T15:15:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "238 Admiral Kalbfus Road. North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T15:15:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "238 Admiral Kalbfus Road. Is the water coming from a drain, or just pooling in the road?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T15:15:19-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Pooling. The drain out front is sitting under it somewhere, I can't even see it. It's been like this since the rain picked up yesterday, and the storm just wrapped up today and it's still not going down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T15:15:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is the water up near your house or any doorways?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T15:15:36-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not in the house yet. It's about a foot from the front step. I'm keeping an eye on it. Look, it wasn't this bad last winter. We had snow, we had rain, nothing like this. Something's plugged."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T15:15:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That makes sense. So you'd like the storm drain in front of 238 Admiral Kalbfus checked and cleaned out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T15:15:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. Cleaned. That's the whole request."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T15:15:58-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I've got it down. I'll send it to the crew supervisor tonight. Crews are stretched thin right after a storm, but it'll be flagged. Can I get a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T15:16:08-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0198."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T15:16:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0198. Got it. If water starts coming toward the house, call back right away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T15:16:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Thanks for picking up."
    }
  ],
